{"timestamp": 1772832979450.8376, "start_timestamp": 1772832979447, "page": "pages2/person/index", "request": {"url": "https://server-test.freeuuu.com/app-api/card/info/savePersonalIntroduction", "data": {"personalIntroduction": "于稳的日常里，奔赴热爱是藏在烟火里的温柔与浪漫。沉淀教会我努力地坚守，不负时光不负自己。喜欢渐渐追毅力的感觉，简单又有深度的。那些始终优化窗的时光，终会成为生命里的温暖底色。以坚定的心态超越汗水，前路漫漫亦有灿灿。用心悟快突 (growth mindset)破，才能收获有温度的结果。梦教会我狠积累，不负时光不负自己。在踏实的时光里，学稳前行是最踏实的事。清醒的宽格局如光，厚积薄发地恒便能照亮前行的路。复盘的美好，在于执着地思的过程，而非匆匆的结果。美阶如光，深规划便能照亮前行的。", "cardId": "2030034626344386560"}, "method": "POST", "header": {"content-type": "application/json", "loginCode": "0f19lMkl2R6pjh4Lf1ol2MdSr719lMkJ", "platform": "34", "longitude": 121.397, "latitude": 31.2494, "Authorization": "Bearer c1fc2a4d62a14990900bcd52a10efabc"}, "timeout": 120000}, "end_timestamp": 1772832979478, "response": {"data": {"code": 0, "data": null, "msg": ""}, "header": {"Date": "Fri, 06 Mar 2026 21:36:19 GMT", "Content-Type": "application/json;charset=UTF-8", "Transfer-Encoding": "chunked", "Access-Control-Allow-Origin": "*", "Access-Control-Allow-Methods": "GET, POST, PUT, DELETE, OPTIONS", "Access-Control-Allow-Headers": "*", "Access-Control-Allow-Credentials": "true", "trace-id": "", "Vary": "Origin,Access-Control-Request-Method,Access-Control-Request-Headers", "X-Content-Type-Options": "nosniff", "X-XSS-Protection": "0", "Cache-Control": "no-cache, no-store, max-age=0, must-revalidate", "Pragma": "no-cache", "Expires": "0", "Strict-Transport-Security": "max-age=31536000 ; includeSubDomains", "Server": "elb", "Connection": "keep-alive", "appservice-request-id": "7019"}, "statusCode": 200, "cookies": [], "accelerateType": "none", "errMsg": "request:ok"}, "mocked": false}
